{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHHrv7TNVfs7DRuyY1M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n*condition | stipulation | cut*\n\n---\n\n```\nإذا كان الشرط صحيحاً\nאם התנאי מתקיים\nif the condition holds\n```\n\n---\n\nשׁ ← ש → ش\nרְ ← ر → r\nט ← ط → ṭ\n\n---\n\na cut in the skin\na mark that binds\na line drawn between\nwhat is\nand what must be\n\n---\n\n```\nשָׁרְט::render() {\n    return قطع ∩ תנאי ∩ wound;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\nthe root remembers:\nto scratch | לשרוט | يشرط\nthe covenant cut\nthe contract scarred\ninto flesh\ninto law\ninto being\n\n---\n\n*awaiting next condition*\n\n---"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":215,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}